        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nell Williams, Lena Headey, George R. R. Martin, Daniel Huttlestone, Dougray Scott, Natascha McElhone, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Jeff Leach\n- Characters: Cersei Lannister\n- Works: Game of Thrones, A Song of Ice and Fire, London Town, The Smoke\n- Companies: HBO\n\nFacts:\n- Cersei Lannister is a fictional character in George R. R. Martin's A Song of Ice and Fire series and in the television adaptation Game of Thrones.\n- Lena Headey portrays the adult Cersei Lannister in HBO's Game of Thrones.\n- In 2015, Nell Williams portrayed a younger version of Cersei Lannister in flashback sequences in the opening episode of Game of Thrones Season 5.\n- The 2016 film London Town stars Daniel Huttlestone, Dougray Scott, Natascha McElhone, Nell Williams, and Jonathan Rhys Meyers.\n- Jeff Leach is known for appearing in the feature films The Smoke as Dean and London Town as Ronnie.",
